    <string name="set_shortcut_title">Keyboard shortcut</string>
    <string name="set_shortcut_text">Booklight opens whenever you start it, so a keyboard shortcut for the app is all it needs.

1. Open Keyboard shortcuts (Action + /).
2. Choose App shortcuts, then Add shortcut.
3. Find Booklight, choose +, press your keys, then Set shortcut.

The system needs the Action key in every shortcut. Action + Alt + Space and Action + K are both free. The same keys close Booklight again.</string>
